msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She thinks I’m the White-Haired Girl, yet she calls me “Master,”⟪k:1⟫completely oblivious to "
"how absurd that sounds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela pensa que eu sou a Garota de Cabelos Brancos, ainda assim me chama de “Mestre”,⟪k:1⟫"
"completamente alheia a quão absurdo isso soa."

